  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONSERV: reducing legal deforestation in Mato Grosso, Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project aims to test different models for compensating farmers for conserving forest assets which could possibly be legally deforested in Mato Grosso, Brazil. The approach creates and recognizes the value of standing forests, bridging the gap between production and conservation.</narrative>
  </description>
